# MoneyPrinterTurbo does not use environment variables directly.
# All API keys and settings are configured in config.toml.
#
# Copy config.example.toml from the app repo to this directory as config.toml,
# then fill in your keys before running docker-compose up.
#
# Required API keys (set in config.toml):
#   openai_api_key       - OpenAI (or compatible provider)
#   pexels_api_keys      - Pexels video API (https://www.pexels.com/api/)
#   pixabay_api_keys     - Pixabay video API (https://pixabay.com/api/docs/)
#   gemini_api_key       - Google Gemini (optional)
#   azure speech_key     - Azure TTS (optional)
#
# The config.toml file is mounted read-only into both containers at:
#   /MoneyPrinterTurbo/config.toml
